WEBVTT

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:05.220
Monday morning. No angry voicemails.

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:08.790
Riley's table went out at 53 of 54,

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:10.980
with the one missing game named.

00:00:11.856 --> 00:00:13.626
That is what Friday taught.

00:00:13.856 --> 00:00:16.586
No errors describes only the program.

00:00:16.896 --> 00:00:20.026
A coverage record, checked against what should exist,

00:00:20.096 --> 00:00:21.466
describes the data.

00:00:21.616 --> 00:00:24.266
And anything it can't see is unknown.

00:00:24.576 --> 00:00:25.706
Never zero.

00:00:28.706 --> 00:00:31.246
Tuesday. Kick adds a tidy rule

00:00:31.266 --> 00:00:33.836
to spell out school names on the published table.

00:00:34.586 --> 00:00:36.796
An "St." becomes State.

00:00:37.106 --> 00:00:38.396
Great for Brightwater.

00:00:38.626 --> 00:00:40.556
Less great for State Lambert.

00:00:44.074 --> 00:00:46.374
<v Iris>Hi, this is Saint Lambert soccer.

00:00:46.394 --> 00:00:48.614
<v Iris>Saint, as in the saint.

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:50.964
<v Iris>Your table says State Lambert.

00:00:51.034 --> 00:00:52.694
<v Iris>We are not a state school.

00:00:52.714 --> 00:00:53.844
<v Iris>Please fix it.

00:00:54.876 --> 00:00:57.176
<v Kick>You're absolutely right, and I apologize.

00:00:57.196 --> 00:01:00.296
<v Kick>Fixed. Saint stays Saint.

00:01:00.316 --> 00:01:01.286
<v Kick>One line.

00:01:04.098 --> 00:01:05.518
The code is fixed in a minute.

00:01:05.538 --> 00:01:07.068
Friday's table isn't.

00:01:07.358 --> 00:01:08.738
Ask the eight sites again,

00:01:08.758 --> 00:01:10.808
and you won't get Friday's standings.

00:01:11.018 --> 00:01:12.628
<v Kick>Re-fetching!

00:01:13.098 --> 00:01:14.598
You'll get Tuesday's pages,

00:01:14.618 --> 00:01:16.548
with weekend updates mixed in.

00:01:17.408 --> 00:01:19.738
And Dunmore might not answer at all.

00:01:21.858 --> 00:01:24.268
This time, Riley knows what to ask.

00:01:25.276 --> 00:01:28.056
<v Riley>Can you rebuild Friday's table from the pages you kept,

00:01:28.076 --> 00:01:30.016
<v Riley>without asking a single site again,

00:01:30.036 --> 00:01:31.286
<v Riley>and show me you did?

00:01:32.274 --> 00:01:33.294
<v Kick>Great question.
